OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSevere gales in the south and
OL,6,Fwest, as Storm Austen moves its way
OL,7,Feastwards, these easing later. Winds
OL,8,Fincreasing through the day elsewhere,
OL,9,Fwith heavy rain or showers for many
OL,10,Fbut turning drier in the west. Feeling
OL,11,Frather cold.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStorm Austen moves off
OL,14,Ftowards the North Sea as winds slowly
OL,15,Fease overnight. Much drier for all but
OL,16,Frain and showers move into the west by
OL,17,Fdawn. Staying rather cloudy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
