OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FStorm Boelo moves into the
OL,6,Fnorthwest, bringing widespread rain
OL,7,Ffor all, heaviest in the west. Winds
OL,8,Fstrengthen through the day with the
OL,9,Fstrongest being in the north and west.
OL,10,FMild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
